,"Welcome":[""],"Demos":[""],"Pricing":[""],"Copy To Clipboard":[""],"Copied Successfully!":[""],"Preview & Save Favorites":[""],"Click the <strong>eye<\/strong> icon on a template to open its live demo in a new tab, or the <strong>heart<\/strong> icon to save it - favorites stay one click away under the <strong>Favorites<\/strong> tab.":[""],"Import & Customize":[""],"Hit <strong>+ Import<\/strong> and the template is inserted right into your content as editable blocks - then tweak the query, elements, and styles as usual. Pro templates show <strong>Get Pro<\/strong> until your license is active.":[""],"ShortCode":[""],"Open ShortCode Generator":[""],"Go to <strong>Advanced Posts &rsaquo; ShortCode Generator<\/strong> in your WordPress admin and click <strong>Add New ShortCode<\/strong>.":[""],"Configure the Block":[""],"In the block editor, use the sidebar to choose your layout, set the Posts Query filters (post type, categories, tags, order), and adjust Elements and Style settings.":[""],"Publish & Copy the Shortcode":[""],"Publish the post. Return to the ShortCode Generator list - the shortcode <code>[apb id=POST_ID]<\/code> is shown in the list table. Click it to copy to clipboard.":[""],"Paste Anywhere":[""],"Paste the copied shortcode (e.g. <code>[apb id=123]<\/code>) into any post, page, widget area, or block using the <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> block.":[""],"Page Builder":[""],"Create a ShortCode":[""],"Go to <strong>Advanced Posts &rsaquo; ShortCode Generator<\/strong>, click <strong>Add New ShortCode<\/strong>, configure your layout and query, then publish. Note the shortcode from the list table.":[""],"ShortCode Generator":[""],"Showcase Posts with Grid, List, Card Layouts and Filters":[""],"Add a Shortcode Widget":[""],"Add the Page Builder <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> widget to your page and insert to the page.":[""],"Enter & Preview":[""],"Type <code>[apb id=YOUR_ID]<\/code> into the widget's Shortcode field (replace <em>YOUR_ID<\/em> with your actual